1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,050
Once, there was a young man who faced
many struggles.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:12,120
No matter how hard he tried, nothing
worked out as he hoped.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,730
Little by little, he began to lose hope.

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,040
To his close friend he said: I do not
want to try anymore.

5
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,350
His friend listened carefully and told
him:

6
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:42,910
Success is not always winning; falling
is also life's lesson.

7
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:50,040
Even if today failed, tomorrow brings a
new chance; you are strong.

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:58,080
The young man smiled softly and began to
try again.

9
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:05,270
Failure is not the end; as long as there
is hope, there is a new beginning.
